@IssueTracker_HostAddress = https://localhost:8000


### Hämta alla supportärenden

GET {{IssueTracker_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Accept: application/json


### Skapa supportärende

POST {{IssueTracker_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dominoskrivaren",
  "description": "Dominoskrivaren ligger nere på T2, det är kaos.",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Radera supportärende

DELETE {{IssueTracker_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/10

### Uppdatera supportärende

PUT {{IssueTracker_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Kan inte mitt lösenord",
  "description": "Dole måste fixa mitt lösenord, tar ju åratal.",
  "status": "Open",
  "priority": "High"
}

### PATCH - Ändra status

PATCH {{IssueTracker_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/3
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json

[
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/status",
    "value": "Open"
  }
]